id: pm-graph-prepared-runtime-parity
title: Verify or rebuild the prepared release artifact before publishing version 2026.11.15
description: "The already merged release metadata at f951fed926899b932966fc0bd9adb954a213ff22 declares 2026.11.15 while source and built runtime still declare 2026.11.12. Registry latest observed during the audit is 2026.11.12 and requesting pm-graph@2026.11.15 returned E404. The caller fix repairs future preparation and current source/dist parity, but cannot retroactively repair a previously prepared release artifact. Before publication, inspect that artifact and rebuild through an explicitly authorized recovery if needed. No release or recovery was performed by this audit."
